SUMMARY:Flo & Joan: With Feeling (WIP)
LOCATION:Monkey Barrel Comedy - Monkey Barrel 4\, 9-12 Blair Street\, EH1 1
 QR\, Edinburgh
DESCRIPTION:A brand new work-in-progress show from acclaimed musical comedy
  duo Flo & Joan. Returning to the Fringe for five mornings only\, Flo & Joa
 n have stolen a “real band”’s setlist and are using it to write their
  new show\, With Feeling. As seen on Live at the Apollo (BBC2)\, The Royal 
 Variety Performance (ITV)\, Comic Relief (BBC1)\, The Russell Howard Hour (
 SKY) and their live specials Alive on Stage (Amazon Prime) and Sweet Releas
 e (SKY). ‘Truly Exceptional’ (Rolling Stone). ‘Musical comedy hasn’
 t been in such safe hands for years’ (List).\nMore info: https://comedyat
 las.app/comedy-atlas/event/flo-joan-with-feeling-wip/
